/*
 * Declares the SliceCompareValue class.
 *
 * SliceCompareValue represents a comparison between two slice values. Slice
 * comparisons are implemented by calling a dedicated runtime function that
 * receives both slice operands and performs an element-wise comparison
 * according to the operator’s semantics.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::slice::slicecompare
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/slice/slicecompare.yr
 * @Author(s):
